{"4015450": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Last Route Together - Ashwood Trip", "steam_appid": 4015450, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Last Route Together is an episodic psychological horror game in which each episode tells a short story revealed by a survivor.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>This is the first episode of the series:</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015450/extras/30a8d10b6c6ddb7fac1e19cde991b1ec.poster.avif?t=1787166852\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015450/extras/30a8d10b6c6ddb7fac1e19cde991b1ec.webm?t=1787166852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015450/extras/30a8d10b6c6ddb7fac1e19cde991b1ec.mp4?t=1787166852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Last Route Together - Ashwood Trip</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the first episode of The Last Route Together, you play as Sam, preparing for a trip you promised your friend. Alone at home on New Year’s Eve, you and Brian, aspiring filmmakers, plan to make a short horror movie. The trip quickly turns deadly as strange events unfold, and your stop at a quiet gas station to buy supplies becomes your last chance to feel safe before the nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a first-person narrative walking simulator with driving, exploration, and interactive conversations, featuring dynamic environments and immersive gameplay elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p clas